  "description": "Test build of Azir's Sun Disc, his Imperial Guards facing the charge and his sand soldiers from the side (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Azir so that the Sun Disc rises from a fallen tower's ruin - his, or the enemy's outside their base - every 90 seconds (League's cooldown) and strikes the nearest enemy every second, the guards of Emperor's Divide face the way the wall charges and stand as a wall for 5 seconds, and his sand soldiers stand side-on facing the nearest enemy and thrust their spears when they strike, joined to him by a line of flowing sand while they stand within his reach (League's 660); a soldier he leaves out of that reach stops and crumbles, and one in an enemy tower's range ages twice as fast (the data pack cannot see the towers, the wall's direction, which side an enemy is on, nor draw a line between two moving points). His skills are otherwise the main pack's. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-04",
  "mod_id": "league_azir",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Azir's Sun Disc, charging guards and side-on soldiers (test)",
  "version": "0.2.0"
}
